5. SOURCE CODE AVAILABILITY

5.1 The source code of the Software is published in a public repository on GitHub so that it can be
    read. It is not open source. Except as sections 5.2 and 5.3 allow, sections 2 and 4 apply to it
    in full.

5.2 Because the repository is public on GitHub, GitHub's Terms of Service let GitHub users view and
    fork it within GitHub, and let GitHub and its affiliates use its content as those terms describe.
