    right to distribute the Software or builds of it.

5.3 You may download the source code and build and run it on devices you own or control, only to
    evaluate the Software, to investigate or report a problem, or to prepare a Contribution under
    section 6, including making the changes that Contribution needs in a fork on GitHub. Such builds
