8. DATA AND PRIVACY

What the Software keeps on your device, what it sends and how to turn sending off are described in
the Software (Settings > Data and Settings > Hearthpulse account), in the installer notes (on macOS
and Linux, README.txt in the package) and in the "Privacy" section of the README in the public
repository. How hearthpulse.net processes the data of your account, including games uploaded to your
profile, and how to export or delete it, is described in its privacy policy at
https://hearthpulse.net/privacy. These descriptions are information, not terms of this agreement, and
nothing in this agreement limits your rights under data protection law.


